{"videoId":"OnferoJ9J-0","title":"Đề luyện nghe N4 · Bài 01","sentenceVersion":"2026-10-04-v1","cues":[{"id":"sentence-0","text":"日本語能力試験これからN4の会試験を始めます。","start":4.24,"end":18.199,"readings":[{"word":"日本語","reading":"にほんご","offset":0},{"word":"能力","reading":"のうりょく","offset":3},{"word":"試験","reading":"しけん","offset":5},{"word":"会","reading":"かい","offset":14},{"word":"試験","reading":"しけん","offset":15},{"word":"始め","reading":"はじめ","offset":18}]},{"id":"sentence-1","text":"メモを取ってもいいです。","start":18.199,"end":22.119,"readings":[{"word":"取っ","reading":"とっ","offset":3}]},{"id":"sentence-2","text":"問題用紙を開けてください。","start":22.119,"end":27.439,"readings":[{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":0},{"word":"用紙","reading":"ようし","offset":2},{"word":"開け","reading":"あけ","offset":5}]},{"id":"sentence-3","text":"問題1問題1ではまず質問を聞いてください。","start":30.64,"end":34.264,"readings":[{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":0},{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":3},{"word":"質問","reading":"しつもん","offset":10},{"word":"聞い","reading":"きい","offset":13}]},{"id":"sentence-4","text":"それから話を聞いて問題用紙の","start":34.264,"end":36.68,"readings":[{"word":"話","reading":"はなし","offset":4},{"word":"聞い","reading":"きい","offset":6},{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":9},{"word":"用紙","reading":"ようし","offset":11}]},{"id":"sentence-5","text":"1から4の中から1番いいものを1つ選んでください。","start":43.079,"end":50.559,"readings":[{"word":"中","reading":"なか","offset":5},{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":9},{"word":"選ん","reading":"えらん","offset":17}]},{"id":"sentence-6","text":"1番お母さんと男の子が話しています。","start":55.44,"end":57.959,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":1},{"word":"お母さん","reading":"おかあさん","offset":2},{"word":"男の子","reading":"おとこのこ","offset":7},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":11}]},{"id":"sentence-7","text":"男の子はこれから何を買いますか?","start":57.959,"end":60.199,"readings":[{"word":"男の子","reading":"おとこのこ","offset":0},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":8},{"word":"買い","reading":"かい","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-8","text":"まさく出かけるの?","start":67.04,"end":69.84,"readings":[{"word":"出かける","reading":"でかける","offset":3}]},{"id":"sentence-9","text":"うん。","start":69.84,"end":70.249,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-10","text":"新しい漫画が出たから本屋に行くんだよ。","start":70.249,"end":72.84,"readings":[{"word":"新しい","reading":"あたらしい","offset":0},{"word":"漫画","reading":"まんが","offset":3},{"word":"出","reading":"で","offset":6},{"word":"本屋","reading":"ほんや","offset":10},{"word":"行く","reading":"いく","offset":13}]},{"id":"sentence-11","text":"じゃあ帰りにスーパーに寄ってくれない?","start":75.32,"end":78.32,"readings":[{"word":"帰り","reading":"かえり","offset":3},{"word":"寄っ","reading":"よっ","offset":11}]},{"id":"sentence-12","text":"へえ?","start":79.119,"end":80.354,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-13","text":"嫌だよ。","start":80.354,"end":82,"readings":[{"word":"嫌","reading":"いや","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-14","text":"じゃあ晩御飯はないよ。","start":82,"end":84.799,"readings":[{"word":"晩","reading":"ばん","offset":3},{"word":"御飯","reading":"ごはん","offset":4}]},{"id":"sentence-15","text":"ええ、それは困る。","start":84.799,"end":86.085,"readings":[{"word":"困る","reading":"こまる","offset":6}]},{"id":"sentence-16","text":"何を買ってくればいいの?","start":86.085,"end":87.799,"readings":[{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":0},{"word":"買っ","reading":"かっ","offset":2}]},{"id":"sentence-17","text":"今んはすき焼きだから肉と野菜を買ってきて。","start":91.52,"end":94.52,"readings":[{"word":"今","reading":"いま","offset":0},{"word":"すき焼き","reading":"すきやき","offset":3},{"word":"肉","reading":"にく","offset":10},{"word":"野菜","reading":"やさい","offset":12},{"word":"買っ","reading":"かっ","offset":15}]},{"id":"sentence-18","text":"男の子はこれから何を買いますか?","start":100.92,"end":103.92,"readings":[{"word":"男の子","reading":"おとこのこ","offset":0},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":8},{"word":"買い","reading":"かい","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-19","text":"番。","start":119.84,"end":121.32,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-20","text":"男の人と女の人がデパートで話しています。","start":121.32,"end":124.32,"readings":[{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":2},{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":4},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":6},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":13}]},{"id":"sentence-21","text":"2人はどこで会いますか?","start":127.68,"end":130.88,"readings":[{"word":"人","reading":"にん","offset":1},{"word":"会い","reading":"あい","offset":6}]},{"id":"sentence-22","text":"次何を見ようか。","start":131.84,"end":134.56,"readings":[{"word":"次","reading":"じ","offset":0},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":1},{"word":"見よ","reading":"みよ","offset":3}]},{"id":"sentence-23","text":"私洋服買いたいから3階に行きたい。","start":134.56,"end":139.319,"readings":[{"word":"私","reading":"わたし","offset":0},{"word":"洋服","reading":"ようふく","offset":1},{"word":"買い","reading":"かい","offset":3},{"word":"階","reading":"かい","offset":10},{"word":"行き","reading":"いき","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-24","text":"へえ。","start":139.319,"end":139.793,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-25","text":"洋服見るの?","start":139.793,"end":140.74,"readings":[{"word":"洋服","reading":"ようふく","offset":0},{"word":"見る","reading":"みる","offset":2}]},{"id":"sentence-26","text":"時間かかりそうだな。","start":140.74,"end":142.319,"readings":[{"word":"時間","reading":"じかん","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-27","text":"嫌ならどこか別のところ見てれば?","start":145.16,"end":148.16,"readings":[{"word":"嫌","reading":"いや","offset":0},{"word":"別","reading":"べつ","offset":6},{"word":"見","reading":"み","offset":11}]},{"id":"sentence-28","text":"そうするよ。","start":149.2,"end":150.665,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-29","text":"僕は6階に行ってCD見てくるよ。","start":150.665,"end":154.57,"readings":[{"word":"僕","reading":"ぼく","offset":0},{"word":"階","reading":"かい","offset":3},{"word":"行っ","reading":"いっ","offset":5},{"word":"見","reading":"み","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-30","text":"それで1時間後にどこかで会おうよ。","start":154.57,"end":158.72,"readings":[{"word":"時間","reading":"じかん","offset":4},{"word":"後","reading":"ご","offset":6},{"word":"会お","reading":"あお","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-31","text":"分かった。","start":158.72,"end":160.018,"readings":[{"word":"分かっ","reading":"わかっ","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-32","text":"じゃあ3階のエレベーター前はうーん。","start":160.018,"end":164.692,"readings":[{"word":"階","reading":"かい","offset":4},{"word":"前","reading":"まえ","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-33","text":"それでもいいけど1時間後はお昼だから8階のレストランに行かない?","start":164.692,"end":173,"readings":[{"word":"時間","reading":"じかん","offset":9},{"word":"後","reading":"ご","offset":11},{"word":"お昼","reading":"おひる","offset":13},{"word":"階","reading":"かい","offset":19},{"word":"行か","reading":"いか","offset":27}]},{"id":"sentence-34","text":"わかった。","start":173,"end":174.333,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-35","text":"じゃあ8階のエレベーター前でね。","start":174.333,"end":178.599,"readings":[{"word":"階","reading":"かい","offset":4},{"word":"前","reading":"まえ","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-36","text":"2人はどこで会いますか?","start":182.8,"end":187.68,"readings":[{"word":"人","reading":"にん","offset":1},{"word":"会い","reading":"あい","offset":6}]},{"id":"sentence-37","text":"3番先生が学生に話しています。","start":200.08,"end":206.599,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":1},{"word":"先生","reading":"せんせい","offset":2},{"word":"学生","reading":"がくせい","offset":5},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":8}]},{"id":"sentence-38","text":"は明後日の授業に何を持ってこなければなりませんか?","start":206.599,"end":209.599,"readings":[{"word":"明後日","reading":"みょうごにち","offset":1},{"word":"授業","reading":"じゅぎょう","offset":5},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":8},{"word":"持っ","reading":"もっ","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-39","text":"え、明後日の授業ですが、皆さんには大切なものについて話してもらいます。","start":213.959,"end":215.769,"readings":[{"word":"明後日","reading":"みょうごにち","offset":2},{"word":"授業","reading":"じゅぎょう","offset":6},{"word":"皆さん","reading":"みなさん","offset":12},{"word":"大切","reading":"たいせつ","offset":17},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":26}]},{"id":"sentence-40","text":"明後日は皆さん大切なものを持ってきてください。","start":215.769,"end":216.959,"readings":[{"word":"明後日","reading":"みょうごにち","offset":0},{"word":"皆さん","reading":"みなさん","offset":4},{"word":"大切","reading":"たいせつ","offset":7},{"word":"持っ","reading":"もっ","offset":13}]},{"id":"sentence-41","text":"例えば家族の写真や友達からもらった誕生日プレゼントなど何でもいいです。","start":228.72,"end":237.64,"readings":[{"word":"例えば","reading":"たとえば","offset":0},{"word":"家族","reading":"かぞく","offset":3},{"word":"写真","reading":"しゃしん","offset":6},{"word":"友達","reading":"ともだち","offset":9},{"word":"誕生","reading":"たんじょう","offset":17},{"word":"日","reading":"び","offset":19},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":27}]},{"id":"sentence-42","text":"それから宿題があります。","start":237.64,"end":241.36,"readings":[{"word":"宿題","reading":"しゅくだい","offset":4}]},{"id":"sentence-43","text":"どんなことをみんなに言いたいか紙に書いてきてください。","start":241.36,"end":247.28,"readings":[{"word":"言い","reading":"いい","offset":10},{"word":"紙","reading":"し","offset":15},{"word":"書い","reading":"かい","offset":17}]},{"id":"sentence-44","text":"宿題は明日までに出してくださいね。","start":247.28,"end":254.852,"readings":[{"word":"宿題","reading":"しゅくだい","offset":0},{"word":"明日","reading":"あした","offset":3},{"word":"出し","reading":"だし","offset":8}]},{"id":"sentence-45","text":"学生は明後日の授業に何を持ってこなければなりませんか?","start":255.84,"end":264.4,"readings":[{"word":"学生","reading":"がくせい","offset":0},{"word":"明後日","reading":"みょうごにち","offset":3},{"word":"授業","reading":"じゅぎょう","offset":7},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":10},{"word":"持っ","reading":"もっ","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-46","text":"4番男の人と女の人が電話で話しています。","start":276.72,"end":284.24,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":1},{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":2},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":4},{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":6},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":8},{"word":"電話","reading":"でんわ","offset":10},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":13}]},{"id":"sentence-47","text":"男の人はいつCDを返しますか?","start":284.24,"end":289.8,"readings":[{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":2},{"word":"返し","reading":"かえし","offset":9}]},{"id":"sentence-48","text":"もしもし。","start":290.039,"end":290.872,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-49","text":"あのさ、今日って家にいる?","start":290.872,"end":293.039,"readings":[{"word":"今日","reading":"きょう","offset":4},{"word":"家","reading":"いえ","offset":8}]},{"id":"sentence-50","text":"今ね、ちょっと出かけてるんだ。","start":295.32,"end":296.987,"readings":[{"word":"今","reading":"いま","offset":0},{"word":"出かけ","reading":"でかけ","offset":7}]},{"id":"sentence-51","text":"でも夕方には家に帰るよ。","start":296.987,"end":298.32,"readings":[{"word":"夕方","reading":"ゆうがた","offset":2},{"word":"家","reading":"いえ","offset":6},{"word":"帰る","reading":"かえる","offset":8}]},{"id":"sentence-52","text":"あ、そうなんだ。","start":302.52,"end":304.159,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-53","text":"この間借りたを返そうと思ってね。","start":304.159,"end":307.436,"readings":[{"word":"間借り","reading":"まがり","offset":2},{"word":"返そ","reading":"かえそ","offset":7},{"word":"思っ","reading":"おもっ","offset":11}]},{"id":"sentence-54","text":"何時頃を家に帰る?","start":307.436,"end":309.28,"readings":[{"word":"何","reading":"なん","offset":0},{"word":"時","reading":"じ","offset":1},{"word":"頃","reading":"ごろ","offset":2},{"word":"家","reading":"いえ","offset":4},{"word":"帰る","reading":"かえる","offset":6}]},{"id":"sentence-55","text":"うーん、6時頃かな。","start":311.12,"end":314.8,"readings":[{"word":"時","reading":"じ","offset":5},{"word":"頃","reading":"ごろ","offset":6}]},{"id":"sentence-56","text":"6時か。","start":314.8,"end":316.639,"readings":[{"word":"時","reading":"じ","offset":1}]},{"id":"sentence-57","text":"6時からアルバイトなんだよね。","start":316.639,"end":319.68,"readings":[{"word":"時","reading":"じ","offset":1}]},{"id":"sentence-58","text":"そうなんだ。","start":319.68,"end":320.372,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-59","text":"じゃあアルバイト終わってからでもいいよ。","start":320.372,"end":322.68,"readings":[{"word":"終わっ","reading":"おわっ","offset":8}]},{"id":"sentence-60","text":"でも夜遅くなるよ。","start":325.12,"end":325.914,"readings":[{"word":"夜","reading":"よる","offset":2},{"word":"遅く","reading":"おそく","offset":3}]},{"id":"sentence-61","text":"あ、明日の夕方でもいい。","start":325.914,"end":326.973,"readings":[{"word":"明日","reading":"あした","offset":2},{"word":"夕方","reading":"ゆうがた","offset":5}]},{"id":"sentence-62","text":"明日はアルバイトないから。","start":326.973,"end":328.12,"readings":[{"word":"明日","reading":"あした","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-63","text":"うん。","start":334.16,"end":335.06,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-64","text":"それでいいよ。","start":335.06,"end":337.16,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-65","text":"男の人はいつCDを返しますか?","start":341.24,"end":347.919,"readings":[{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":2},{"word":"返し","reading":"かえし","offset":9}]},{"id":"sentence-66","text":"問題2問題2ではま質問を聞いてください。","start":360.96,"end":369.12,"readings":[{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":0},{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":3},{"word":"質問","reading":"しつもん","offset":9},{"word":"聞い","reading":"きい","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-67","text":"その後問題用紙を見てください。","start":369.12,"end":374.088,"readings":[{"word":"その後","reading":"そのご","offset":0},{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":3},{"word":"用紙","reading":"ようし","offset":5},{"word":"見","reading":"み","offset":8}]},{"id":"sentence-68","text":"読む時間があります。","start":374.088,"end":377.4,"readings":[{"word":"読む","reading":"よむ","offset":0},{"word":"時間","reading":"じかん","offset":2}]},{"id":"sentence-69","text":"それから話を聞いて問題用紙の1から4の中から1番いいものを1つ選んでください","start":377.4,"end":391.639,"readings":[{"word":"話","reading":"はなし","offset":4},{"word":"聞い","reading":"きい","offset":6},{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":9},{"word":"用紙","reading":"ようし","offset":11},{"word":"中","reading":"なか","offset":19},{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":23},{"word":"選ん","reading":"えらん","offset":31}]},{"id":"sentence-70","text":"1番男の人と女の人が話しています。","start":395,"end":399.72,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":1},{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":2},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":4},{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":6},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":8},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-71","text":"男の人はどうして秋葉原に行きましたか?","start":401.599,"end":408.56,"